                <mxCell id="15" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#2e5a2e&quot;&gt;✓ FIXED — requests are never forgotten. Unanswered centers are followed up on until the booking is resolved (no more &quot;one-and-done&quot;), and every request that stalls escalates to a human with reminders until it is closed out.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontColor=#2e5a2e;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=6;size=14;" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="1215" y="760" width="250" height="105" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
            </root>
        </mxGraphModel>
    </diagram>
